1
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:17,120
Over there!

2
00:00:28,839 --> 00:00:29,359
She's up ahead!

3
00:00:29,719 --> 00:00:30,559
We must catch her!

4
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:38,359
I'm willing to go with you.

5
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:51,320
She must have accomplices.

6
00:00:51,799 --> 00:00:52,600
Step up security.

7
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,799
Step right up, take a look!

8
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,400
How's business been lately?

9
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:21,680
In this freezing cold,

10
00:01:22,079 --> 00:01:22,840
barely scraping by.

11
00:01:23,879 --> 00:01:24,439
Sir.

12
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:25,920
I finally found you.

13
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,560
Here's the intelligence you asked for.

14
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:29,599
Please, you must save Rongcheng.

15
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:31,599
Suspicious person over there! Go search!

16
00:01:31,599 --> 00:01:32,200
Sir, get out of here!

17
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,079
I'll take care of them!

18
00:01:33,079 --> 00:01:33,519
Hurry!

19
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:34,920
Go! Get out of here!

20
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,000
Run!

21
00:01:42,319 --> 00:01:42,959
Hurry up!

22
00:02:47,759 --> 00:02:48,400
Search!

23
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:48,960
Yes, sir!

24
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,000
Over here.

25
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,479
Come on.

26
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:44,919
Word came from our informant.

27
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,560
Dali didn't make it.

28
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,000
Chen Min...

29
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,159
was captured by the Japanese, too.

30
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:04,639
Get out of my way!

31
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,240
Calm down!

32
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,599
Going there now is suicide!

33
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,599
Don't be reckless.

34
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,439
Here's what we do.

35
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,599
Baozhu and I will take the guerrillas

36
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,199
and attack the Japanese supply depot

37
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,800
to draw their fire.

38
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:20,519
You and Mingyuan take our men

39
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:22,439
to raid the Japanese POW camp,

40
00:04:23,079 --> 00:04:23,759
rescue Chen Min,

41
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,600
and free all the POWs being held there.

42
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:26,879
All right.

43
00:04:32,319 --> 00:04:34,079
Where is the guerrillas' hideout?

44
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:55,199
Talk! Where is it?

45
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,120
I don't know!

46
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,240
Are you going to talk?

47
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:06,480
Talk!

48
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,199
Hasn't she talked yet?

49
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,399
Major General, not yet.

50
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:15,079
Her willpower is too strong.

51
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:29,160
Sister Minmin! Sister Minmin!

52
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,879
Xiaoyu!

53
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:33,160
Look at the yummy treats I brought you!

54
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,480
Let's go.

55
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,600
Look, she's here.

56
00:05:40,639 --> 00:05:41,360
Minmin's here.

57
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,160
Uncle, Auntie.

58
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:42,920
Minmin, you're here!

59
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:45,040
I brought you some freshly made

60
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,079
Meiqieyou thousand-layer cake.

61
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:47,680
I want some! I want some!

62
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,639
Xiaoyu, here you go.

63
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,160
Oh, Minmin.

64
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:53,319
As for me,

65
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,040
I got each of you a jade peace amulet.

66
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,839
Come here and try it on.

67
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,680
Does it look nice?

68
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:06,560
Here.

69
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:11,839
Stay safe and sound.

70
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,519
Thank you, Auntie.

71
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:15,720
Safe and sound.

72
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,839
Safe and sound.

73
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:38,160
Get the hell out, you Japanese! Scram!

74
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:39,680
All of you, get the hell away!

75
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:56,199
Telling us to scram?

76
00:06:57,519 --> 00:07:00,399
Have a taste of the chili water!

77
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:08,519
It hurts! It hurts!

78
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,519
Tell me.

79
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:30,879
Those elusive Chinese soldiers...

80
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,120
where are they?

81
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:40,120
I don't understand what you're asking.

82
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,879
Major General, bad news!

83
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,920
A group of Chinese soldiers attacked the supply depot!

84
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:54,639
Yuna...

85
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,480
What should we do with her?

86
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:09,160
Kill me! Kill me if you have the guts!

87
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:15,079
Kill her.

88
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,720
Kill her.

89
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:23,639
Minmin.

90
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:25,720
Minmin.

91
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,720
It's me, Lian Ye.

92
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,240
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

93
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,519
I'm sorry I'm late.

94
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:39,559
I'm... I'm sorry.

95
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:41,600
Come on, I'm taking you to the hospital.

96
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,639
Brother Lian, hurry!

97
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,200
Patrols are heading this way!

98
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,480
It's too late.

99
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,759
How could this happen?

100
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,720
How did this happen?

101
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,240
Xiaoyu...

102
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:17,080
Xiaoyu is in Inukai Kai's hands.

103
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:19,799
Promise me.

104
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:22,200
Bring him back.

105
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,799
I can't stay with you till the end.

106
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:59,360
Actually, that night you came to see me,

107
00:11:02,159 --> 00:11:03,320
I lied.

108
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,879
When I said I didn't want to be with you

109
00:11:15,639 --> 00:11:16,240
because

110
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,120
I didn't love you.

111
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:26,080
I know.

112
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:28,240
I... I know.

113
00:11:29,679 --> 00:11:30,639
I know.

114
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,399
Minmin, I... I beg you.

115
00:11:33,639 --> 00:11:34,720
I'm begging you,

116
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:37,679
don't leave me.

117
00:11:37,919 --> 00:11:39,399
Please... I'm begging you.

118
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:47,320
Getting to see you one last time...

119
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:50,159
makes me so happy.

120
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,679
Promise me...

121
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,240
you'll live on.

122
00:12:40,639 --> 00:12:41,720
I'm taking you back.

123
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:50,279
I'm taking you back.
